<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="separator" data-kv-variant="content" data-klic-component="separator" class="kn-separator"><header data-part="heading"><strong>프로젝트 정보</strong></header><div class="ku-row" data-part="row"><span>담당</span><span>김하늘</span></div><div class="ku-row" data-part="row"><span>상태</span><span><span data-part="badge">진행 중</span></span></div><hr data-part="separator"><header data-part="heading"><strong>연결된 자료</strong></header><ul data-part="list"><li>브랜드 가이드</li><li>디자인 토큰</li></ul></div>
